1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,690
This is what a normal day looked like. I didn't know it yet.

2
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:09,660
My alarm went off at seven. I hit snooze twice, like always.

3
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:13,350
I brushed my teeth in the same mirror, with the same face.

4
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:18,960
Walked to the bus stop past the same houses. The same cat sat on the same fence.

5
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:25,210
Afternoon cartoons. Then the news said a city name I had never heard of. I changed the channel.

6
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:30,500
I sat on the porch until the streetlights came on. It was the best day I ever had.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,390
That night I left my window open. Someone was standing under the streetlight. I figured they were waiting for a friend.
